        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n39" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The customer sits outside the system. They never&lt;br&gt;enter data themselves; a staff member does it&lt;br&gt;for them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Process 1.0 guards everything else. No other&lt;br&gt;process can run without a valid token.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Processes 2.0 to 4.0 are the daily operations.&lt;br&gt;Processes 5.0 and 6.0 only read what the others&lt;br&gt;have written.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Store D6 is written by almost every process.&lt;br&gt;That is the audit trail." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#ffffcc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="120" width="280" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
